ert</td><td/></tr><tr><td>448141006 (Specimen unsatisfactory for evaluation due to marked cellular degeneration)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Zelldegeneration</td><td/></tr><tr><td>710070002 (Specimen unsatisfactory for evaluation due to broken container)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Probenbehaelterzerbrochen (Probenbehälter zerbrochen)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>712743008 (Specimen unsatisfactory for evaluation due to improper storage of specimen)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>Haemolyse (Hämolyse)</td><td>Der Begriff \"Hämolyse\" grenzt den Begriff \"Specimen unsatisfactory for evaluation due to improper storage of sample\" aus dem ursprünglichen Codesystem noch weiter ein, sodass der Äquivalenzgrad \"enger\" ist.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 34 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.2.0/CodeSystem-v2-0493.html\">specimenConditionversion: 3.0.0)</a> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-KBV-CS-MIO-LAB-Specimen-Condition-German.html\">Zustand Probe Germanversion: 1.0.0-update)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>AUT (Autolyzed)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Autolysiert</td></tr><tr><td>CFU (Centrifuged)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Zentrifugiert</td></tr><tr><td>CLOT (Clotted)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><t